{
  "id": "demo-001",
  "title": "The Art of Noticing",
  "hook": "Why slowing down might be the most modern skill of all.",
  "level": "CEFR B1",
  "estimated_minutes": 25,
  "word_count": 197,
  "paragraphs": [
    { "id": "p1", "sentence_ids": ["s1", "s2", "s3"] },
    { "id": "p2", "sentence_ids": ["s4", "s5", "s6", "s7"] },
    { "id": "p3", "sentence_ids": ["s8", "s9", "s10", "s11", "s12", "s13", "s14", "s15"] },
    { "id": "p4", "sentence_ids": ["s16", "s17"] }
  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "translation": "在这个充斥着无尽信息流的时代，我们学会了用比思考更快的速度滑动屏幕。",
      "chunks": [
        "In an age of endless feeds,",
        "we have learned to scroll",
        "faster than we can think."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "translation": "我们的眼睛从一张明亮的图片跳向下一张，我们的心思追逐着任何看起来新鲜的事物。",
      "chunks": [
        "Our eyes jump from one bright image to the next,",
        "and our minds chase whatever feels new."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "translation": "然而真相很简单：任何有意义的东西都无法在匆忙中被理解。",
      "chunks": [
        "Yet the truth is simple:",
        "nothing meaningful can be understood",
        "in a hurry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "translation": "缓慢地阅读，是一种安静的反抗。",
      "chunks": [
        "Reading slowly",
        "is a quiet kind of rebellion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "translation": "当你选择停留在一句话上时，你就给了它一个让你惊讶的机会。",
      "chunks": [
        "When you choose to stay with a single sentence,",
        "you give it the chance",
        "to surprise you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "translation": "一个你以为自己认识的单词，可能突然带上一种新的色彩。",
      "chunks": [
        "A word you thought you knew",
        "may suddenly carry a new color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "translation": "一行你去年匆匆扫过的句子，今天可能会让你停下来，并问你一个你回答不了的问题。",
      "chunks": [
        "A line you skimmed last year",
        "may stop you today",
        "and ask a question you cannot answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "translation": "这就是留意的艺术。",
      "chunks": [
        "This is the art of noticing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "translation": "它不需要天赋，也不需要特殊的工具。",
      "chunks": [
        "It does not require talent",
        "or special tools."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "translation": "它只要求耐心，以及一份愿意安静下来的心。",
      "chunks": [
        "It only asks for patience",
        "and a willingness to be still."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "translation": "今晚就试试吧。",
      "chunks": [
        "Try it tonight."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "translation": "找一个短小的段落，把它读三遍。",
      "chunks": [
        "Find one short paragraph",
        "and read it three times."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "translation": "第一遍，跟随文字。",
      "chunks": [
        "The first time,",
        "follow the words."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "translation": "第二遍，观察作者如何构建意义。",
      "chunks": [
        "The second time,",
        "watch how the writer builds the meaning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "translation": "第三遍，倾听那些没有被说出口的内容。",
      "chunks": [
        "The third time,",
        "listen for what is not said."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "translation": "你会发现，仅仅一页纸所容纳的，可能比一百块屏幕还要多。",
      "chunks": [
        "You will discover",
        "that a single page",
        "can hold more than a hundred screens."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "translation": "而在那个发现里，你或许会重新想起一种我们几乎遗忘的感受：那份认真留意时的安静喜悦。",
      "chunks": [
        "And in that discovery,",
        "you may begin to remember a feeling",
        "we have almost forgotten:",
        "the quiet joy of paying attention."
      ]
    }
  ],
